            <ArticleTitle>Sensory and pharmacological modulation of pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>695-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Traditional neurosurgical methods to control pain have been replaced by a variety of modulation techniques. The major types of modulation are pharmacological, physical, and psychological. Important advances are occurring in the development of all three modulation approaches.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
